00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:17.578 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le professeur en gestion

00:01:15.209 --> 00:01:18.779 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'ITHQ, l'Institut

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:20.013 size:53% position:73% line:53%
