00:01:18.879 --> 00:01:22.449 size:53% position:73% line:53%
moyenne, pour 100 $ de revenus,

00:01:20.114 --> 00:01:23.684 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un restaurateur paie environ

00:01:21.348 --> 00:01:24.918 size:53% position:73% line:53%
34 $ pour la nourriture,

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:26.153 size:53% position:73% line:53%
33 $ pour la main-d'oeuvre,

00:01:23.784 --> 00:01:27.354 size:53% position:73% line:53%
18 $ pour le l

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:28.589 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et 10 pour d'autres frais,

00:01:26.253 --> 00:01:29.823 size:53% position:73% line:53%
si bien que la marge de profit

00:01:27.454 --> 00:01:31.058 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ne dépasse que très rarement

00:01:28.689 --> 00:01:32.259 size:53% position:73% line:53%
5 %. L'une des solutions serait

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:37.931 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'augm p p p p prix des plats,

00:01:31.158 --> 00:01:39.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ce que plusieurs refusent

00:01:32.359 --> 00:01:40.601 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de faire.

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:41.935 size:53% position:73% line:53%
FRANÇOIS PAGEAU, professeur de

00:01:39.366 --> 00:01:43.270 size:53% position:73% line:53%
gestion en restauration, ITHQ

00:01:40.701 --> 00:01:44.605 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Si il y a pas de clients,

00:01:42.036 --> 00:01:45.939 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ntntntntnt, il y a pas

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:47.274 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de business. Donc, il faut

00:01:44.705 --> 00:01:48.609 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'abord s'assurer d'avoir

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:49.910 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'achalandage. Et pour

00:01:47.374 --> 00:01:51.278 size:53% position:73% line:53%
assurer cet achalandage-là,

00:01:48.709 --> 00:01:52.613 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on veut maintenir les prix

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:53.947 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le plus bas possible.

00:01:51.378 --> 00:01:55.282 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Mais au Mousso, un repas pour

00:01:52.713 --> 00:01:56.617 size:53% position:73% line:53%
deux peut coûter jusqu'à 900 $.

00:01:54.014 --> 00:01:57.951 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'c'c'c'c'c'est sûr qu'on offre

00:01:55.382 --> 00:01:59.286 size:53% position:73% line:53%
plus que 13,50. Même un salaire

00:01:56.717 --> 00:02:00.587 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de base de plongeur est...

00:01:58.051 --> 00:02:07.094 size:53% position:73% line:53%
